    <string name="control_section_title">Voice Wake-Up Interception Control</string>
    <string name="control_voice_only_notice">💡 Smart Voice vs. Manual Distinction: This tool only intercepts when "voice wake-up" triggers a voice wake-up service or recording status notification (e.g. "收音 (藍心小V)", OPPO Breeno, or Xiaomi XiaoAi) and force-stops it; opening the stock Chinese assistant app manually from your home screen to type or use built-in features is never interfered with!</string>
