    <string name="dialog_about_title">About CN Voice Intercept (陸版語音呼喚攔截)</string>
    <string name="dialog_about_body">Author: dx9901mk5\nVersion: v%1$s\n\n[中文]\n專為 vivo (OriginOS)、OPPO (ColorOS)、小米 (HyperOS) 陸版 CN ROM 打造的語音喚醒攔截工具。當透過語音呼喊陸版助理時，利用 Shizuku 瞬間強制終止陸版助理並直接啟動 Gemini 圈選／浮層視窗（或自選 AI App），且不干涉平時手動點開陸版助理使用。\n\n[English]\nBuilt for vivo (OriginOS), OPPO (ColorOS), and Xiaomi (HyperOS) Mainland China ROMs. Uses Shizuku to intercept voice wake-up calls, force-stop the stock Chinese assistant, and directly launch Google Gemini or your chosen AI app—without interfering with manual app launches.</string>
